ns from persisted records alone, return empty lists when no records exist, and include records created through contract write operations.\"\n }\n]\n</artifact>\n\n<failures>\nYour previous attempt was rejected for these reasons. Fix them:\n- [spec-lint L8 anchors] REQ-11 has an anchor that doesn't match the code\n</failures>\n\nMap the sentences."}